            "alttitle": "\u96e8\u97f3\u3068\u30cd\u30e0\u306e\u591c",
            "description": "The Night of Rain and Nemu is a short atmospheric visual novel about a lonely girl and a quiet rainy night.\n\nOne rainy evening, the protagonist returns home and finds Nemu waiting alone. Through small conversations and shared moments, the player gradually learns about her loneliness, dependence, and gentle warmth.\n\nThis is a short emotional story focused on atmosphere, quiet intimacy, and rainy-night feelings.\n\n[From [url=https://tac777.itch.io/the-night-of-rain-and-nemu]itch.io[/url]]",
