            "description": "A body suddenly explodes in Suiyo Park, H City, Saitama Prefecture, Japan!\n\nConcluding this was a murder involving \u201cpsychokinesis,\u201d the local police commissioned two girls, \u201cPsychokinetic Detectives\u201d (detectives possessing \u201cpsychokinesis\u201d), to investigate.\n\nThe investigation moves from Saitama Prefecture to Yamaguchi Prefecture, then to Hiroshima Prefecture. What will the girls ultimately witness...?\n\n[From [url=https://store.steampowered.com/app/4012840/]Steam[/url]]",
